     "code": "```python\ndef luhn_valid(s):\n    s = s.replace(\" \", \"\")\n    if len(s) < 2 or not s.isdigit():\n        return False\n    total = 0\n    for i in range(len(s) - 1, -1, -1):\n        digit = int(s[i])\n        if i % 2 == 0:\n            digit *= 2\n            if digit > 9:\n                digit -= 9\n        total += digit\n    return total % 10 == 0\n```",
